                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This is a nice relaxing platformer. I love the artstyle, it's very simple but still visually appeasing. The controls are very responsive, though I do wish I could use space to jump. The music is also pretty good, but it does get repetitive since there is only one song in the game and the only song you will be hearing throughout 36 levels. The levels are very short, each one (maybe) taking 1 - 3 minutes. The main complaint that I have is the options. The options are very barebones even without the option to rebind controls, but there are so little controls that it isn't really necessary for most keyboards. This game is definitely worth the $3.99 (or $1.59 sale price).\n\nNote: While I did get this for free, this is a totally unbiased review based on my own opinions.",
